<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<%- include('partials/head', { title: 'About Us', description: 'BB Catering plans and serves fresh, flexible food experiences for weddings, celebrations and corporate events across Chennai.' }) %>
</head>
<body>
<%- include('partials/nav') %>

<!-- ============ 1. PAGE HEADER ============ -->
<section class="page-header">
  <div class="hero-bg"><div class="ph-photo" style="height:100%;background-image:url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1556910103-1c02745aae4d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1800&q=80')"></div></div>
  <div class="hero-scrim"></div>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="eyebrow">About BB Catering</div>
    <h1>Catering That Makes Hosting Easier.</h1>
    <p class="crumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> / About</p>
    <p class="lead">Fresh food, flexible menus and dependable service for weddings, celebrations and corporate events.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ MARQUEE TICKER ============ -->
<div class="marquee">
  <div class="marquee-track">
    <span class="marquee-item">Wedding Catering</span><span class="marquee-item">Corporate Events</span><span class="marquee-item">Birthday &amp; Private Parties</span><span class="marquee-item">Custom Menus</span><span class="marquee-item">Live Counters</span><span class="marquee-item">Bulk Food Orders</span>
    <span class="marquee-item">Wedding Catering</span><span class="marquee-item">Corporate Events</span><span class="marquee-item">Birthday &amp; Private Parties</span><span class="marquee-item">Custom Menus</span><span class="marquee-item">Live Counters</span><span class="marquee-item">Bulk Food Orders</span>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ============ 2. OUR JOURNEY ============ -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="container split">
    <div class="split-body" data-reveal="left">
      <div class="eyebrow">Our Journey</div>
      <h2>7+ Years of Thoughtful Food Service</h2>
      <p>For over 7 years, <strong>BB Catering</strong> has helped families, companies and event organisers plan food service that suits their occasion. Every event begins with a conversation about guests, preferences, venue and budget.</p>
      <p>We turn that plan into a smooth service experience with freshly prepared food, sensible quantities and an attentive team. Our aim is to let you focus on your guests while we take care of the meal.</p>
      <p class="lede"><%= settings.aboutLede %></p>
    </div>
    <div class="split-media" data-reveal="right">
      <div class="frame"><div class="ph-photo" style="background-image:url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1589302168068-964664d93dc0?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80')"></div></div>
      <div class="accent-ring"></div>
      <div class="frame-badge"><b>7+ Years</b><span>Supporting weddings, celebrations and corporate gatherings</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="divider-strip"><div class="kolam-divider" style="width:220px;"></div></div>

<!-- ============ 3. OUR CORE PRINCIPLES ============ -->
<section class="section section--red" data-reveal="fade">
  <div class="kolam-bg"></div>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head center">
      <div class="eyebrow">Our Core Principles</div>
      <h2>The Pillars Behind Every Memorable Feast</h2>
      <p>From intimate family gatherings to grand wedding receptions, our standards never waver.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="why-grid" data-stagger>
      <div class="why-item" data-reveal="fade">
        <span class="num">01</span>
        <div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><path d="M7 3v6a3 3 0 0 0 3 3v9M17 3c-2 0-3 3-3 6s1 4 3 4v8"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Quality Ingredients</h3>
        <p>Thoughtfully sourced ingredients and fresh preparation for food that feels right for the occasion.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="why-item" data-reveal="fade">
        <span class="num">02</span>
        <div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><path d="M12 2 4 6v6c0 5 3.5 8.5 8 10 4.5-1.5 8-5 8-10V6l-8-4Z"/><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Flexible Planning</h3>
        <p>Menus, quantities and service formats can be adjusted for your guests and event requirements.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="why-item" data-reveal="fade">
        <span class="num">03</span>
        <div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="4"/><path d="M4 21c0-4 3.5-6 8-6s8 2 8 6"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Considered Menus</h3>
        <p>Balanced menu combinations designed to offer variety, comfort and a satisfying guest experience.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="why-item" data-reveal="fade">
        <span class="num">04</span>
        <div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><rect x="2" y="8" width="14" height="9" rx="1.5"/><path d="M16 11h3.2a1 1 0 0 1 .9.55L22 15v2h-6"/><circle cx="7" cy="19" r="1.6"/><circle cx="18" cy="19" r="1.6"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Professional Service</h3>
        <p>Clear coordination, punctual service and a courteous team from planning through completion.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ 4. OUR UNIQUE SIGNATURE ============ -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="container split">
    <div class="split-media" data-reveal="left">
      <div class="frame"><div class="ph-photo" style="background-image:url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1544025162-d76694265947?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80')"></div></div>
      <div class="accent-ring"></div>
      <div class="frame-badge"><b>Signature</b><span>Non-veg classics + non-veg inspired rich veg creations</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="split-body" data-reveal="right">
      <div class="eyebrow">Our Approach</div>
      <h2>A Catering Plan Built Around You</h2>
      <p>Every celebration has different priorities. Our approach is to listen first, recommend clearly and then create a service plan that works for your guests and venue.</p>
      <ul class="tick-list" style="margin-top:18px;">
        <li>
          <span class="tick"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"><path d="M5 12l5 5L20 6"/></svg></span>
          <div><strong>Event-ready menus:</strong> Options for wedding meals, corporate lunches, birthday parties and community celebrations.</div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="tick"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"><path d="M5 12l5 5L20 6"/></svg></span>
          <div><strong>Flexible service formats:</strong> Buffet service, plated meals, packed orders and live counters can be planned where suitable.</div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="tick"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"><path d="M5 12l5 5L20 6"/></svg></span>
          <div><strong>Practical guidance:</strong> We help align selections, quantities and service flow with the size and nature of your event.</div>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="divider-strip"><div class="kolam-divider" style="width:220px;"></div></div>

<!-- ============ 5. VISIT OUR RESTAURANT ============ -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="container split">
    <div class="split-body" data-reveal="left">
      <div class="eyebrow">Let’s Plan Together</div>
      <h2>Tell Us What You’re Celebrating</h2>
      <p>Whether you are planning a wedding, an office gathering or a family milestone, our team is ready to discuss a catering plan that fits your day.</p>
      <p style="margin-top:14px;">Share your event date, expected guest count and preferences. We will help you take the next step with a clear, tailored recommendation.</p>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:22px;">
        <a href="https://wa.me/<%= settings.whatsapp %>?text=Hello%20BB%20Catering%2C%20I%20would%20like%20to%20schedule%20a%20food%20tasting%20session%20at%20Madurai%20Kurakadai%2C%20Mambakkam." target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn--primary">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M17.472 14.382c-.301-.15-1.78-.878-2.056-.978-.276-.1-.476-.15-.677.15-.201.3-.777.978-.952 1.179-.176.2-.351.226-.652.075-.301-.15-1.272-.469-2.424-1.497-.896-.799-1.501-1.787-1.677-2.088-.175-.301-.019-.464.132-.614.136-.135.301-.351.451-.527.151-.176.201-.301.302-.502.101-.2.05-.376-.025-.526-.075-.15-.677-1.633-.928-2.235-.245-.587-.494-.507-.677-.517-.176-.01-.376-.01-.577-.01-.201 0-.526.075-.802.376-.276.301-1.053 1.029-1.053 2.511s1.078 2.912 1.229 3.113c.15.2 2.121 3.239 5.139 4.542.718.31 1.279.495 1.716.634.721.229 1.377.197 1.896.119.579-.087 1.78-.727 2.031-1.429.251-.702.251-1.303.176-1.429-.076-.125-.276-.201-.577-.351zM12.04 2c-5.522 0-10 4.477-10 10 0 1.765.459 3.424 1.261 4.871L2 22l5.281-1.385A9.957 9.957 0 0 0 12.04 22c5.522 0 10-4.478 10-10s-4.478-10-10-10zm0 18.273c-1.564 0-3.023-.424-4.283-1.162l-.307-.182-3.178.833.848-3.097-.2-.318A8.232 8.232 0 0 1 3.766 12c0-4.562 3.712-8.273 8.274-8.273 4.562 0 8.273 3.711 8.273 8.273 0 4.562-3.711 8.273-8.273 8.273z"/></svg>
          Start an Enquiry
        </a>
        <a href="<%= settings.mapUrl || '/contact' %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn--dark-outline">
          Get Directions
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="split-media" data-reveal="right">
      <div class="frame"><div class="ph-photo" style="background-image:url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1517248135467-4c7edcad34c4?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80')"></div></div>
      <div class="accent-ring"></div>
      <div class="frame-badge"><b>Let’s Talk</b><span>Share your plans and we’ll help create the right catering experience</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ 6. CTA BANNER ============ -->
<section class="section--tight">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="cta-banner" data-reveal="scale">
      <div>
        <h2>Make Your Next Event Easy to Host.</h2>
        <p>Plan a menu and service format with the BB Catering team today.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cta-actions">
        <a href="https://wa.me/<%= settings.whatsapp %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn--gold">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M17.472 14.382c-.301-.15-1.78-.878-2.056-.978-.276-.1-.476-.15-.677.15-.201.3-.777.978-.952 1.179-.176.2-.351.226-.652.075-.301-.15-1.272-.469-2.424-1.497-.896-.799-1.501-1.787-1.677-2.088-.175-.301-.019-.464.132-.614.136-.135.301-.351.451-.527.151-.176.201-.301.302-.502.101-.2.05-.376-.025-.526-.075-.15-.677-1.633-.928-2.235-.245-.587-.494-.507-.677-.517-.176-.01-.376-.01-.577-.01-.201 0-.526.075-.802.376-.276.301-1.053 1.029-1.053 2.511s1.078 2.912 1.229 3.113c.15.2 2.121 3.239 5.139 4.542.718.31 1.279.495 1.716.634.721.229 1.377.197 1.896.119.579-.087 1.78-.727 2.031-1.429.251-.702.251-1.303.176-1.429-.076-.125-.276-.201-.577-.351zM12.04 2c-5.522 0-10 4.477-10 10 0 1.765.459 3.424 1.261 4.871L2 22l5.281-1.385A9.957 9.957 0 0 0 12.04 22c5.522 0 10-4.478 10-10s-4.478-10-10-10zm0 18.273c-1.564 0-3.023-.424-4.283-1.162l-.307-.182-3.178.833.848-3.097-.2-.318A8.232 8.232 0 0 1 3.766 12c0-4.562 3.712-8.273 8.274-8.273 4.562 0 8.273 3.711 8.273 8.273 0 4.562-3.711 8.273-8.273 8.273z"/></svg>
          Enquire Now
        </a>
        <a href="/menu" class="btn btn--outline">Explore Menu</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
